  "Sunny Shore": "Costa soleada",
  "Sunrise Savanna, Acacia Crossing, Marshlight Bend, Red Canyon Run, Moonwater Reserve, and Crown Safari share a marked trail network. Scattered trail gear and flooded markers have broken its guide-star chain.": "Sunrise Savanna, Acacia Crossing, Marshlight Bend, Red Canyon Run, Moonwater Reserve y Crown Safari comparten una red de senderos señalizados. El material del sendero disperso y los marcadores inundados han roto su cadena de estrella guía.",
